        <item>
            <title>Version 1.0.13</title>
            <sparkle:version>1.1.13</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.13</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Find similar images, links, and notes with a local model and stricter relevance filtering.</li>
<li>Download progress and animated Similar results.</li>
<li>Remember the Info or Similar panel, its width, and whether it is open.</li>
<li>Floating Liquid Glass controls for images, PDFs, and links.</li>
<li>Blue selection border for context menus and improved detail headers.</li>
<li>A unified library with All, Pinned, Inbox, and Later; the app opens directly in All.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
